<title>UK: BASKETBALL-RESULTS IN MEN'S EUROLEAGUE.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-RESULTS IN MEN'S EUROLEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of men's EuroLeague basketball matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Athens: Panathinaikos (Greece) 75 Olimpija Ljubljana (Slovenia) 67 (halftime 30-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers</p>
<p>Panathinaikos  - Feran Martinez 18, Frangiskos Alvertis 13, Nikos Economou 11</p>
<p>Olimpija - Marian Kraljevic 15, Daren Henry 13, Ariel McDonald 12</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Seville: Sevilla (Spain) 72 Partizan Belgrade (Yugoslavia) 67 (halftime 38-34)  </p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Split: BC Croatia (Croatia) 65 Barcelona (Spain) 75 (halftime 25-37)</p>
<p>Leading scorers</p>
<p>Croatia Osiguranje - Zvonimir Ridl 19, Ante Grgurevic 10, Josip Vrankovic 9</p>
<p>Barcelona - Arturas Karnishovas 24, Xavier Fernandez 10, Roberto Duenas 8</p>
</text>
